    "## 2. Mock Requirement Object Design\n",
    "\n",
    "### Requirement Simulation\n",
    "```python\n",
    "    orchestrator = IntegrationOrchestrator(base_dir=temp_workspace)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # Create mock requirement and test behavior\n",
    "    mock_requirement = Mock()\n",
    "    mock_requirement.title = \"Generate Time Grid\"\n",
    "    mock_requirement.description = \"Generate time grid based on BPM\"\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Requirement Mock Analysis:**\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Mock Object Structure\n",
    "```python\n",
    "mock_requirement = Mock()\n",
    "mock_requirement.title = \"Generate Time Grid\"\n",
    "mock_requirement.description = \"Generate time grid based on BPM\"\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Attribute Design:**\n",
    "- **`title`**: Requirement name/identifier\n",
    "- **`description`**: Detailed requirement description\n",
    "- **Simple attributes**: Basic string values\n",
    "- **Realistic content**: Domain-specific terminology\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Content Strategy\n",
    "**Domain-Specific Language:**\n",
    "- **\"Generate Time Grid\"**: Clear requirement title\n",
    "- **\"Generate time grid based on BPM\"**: Specific functionality\n",
    "- **Technical terms\": \"BPM\" (beats per minute)\n",
    "- **Action-oriented**: \"Generate\" indicates creation\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Mock Benefits\n",
    "**Why Use Mock for Requirement?**\n",
    "- **Interface compliance**: Matches real requirement object structure\n",
    "- **Lightweight**: No full requirement object needed\n",
    "- **Controlled data**: Predictable content for testing\n",
    "- **Focus on algorithm**: Test similarity calculation, not object creation"
