    "## 3. Test Behavior Mock Design\n",
    "\n",
    "### Test Behavior Simulation\n",
    "```python\n",
    "    test_behavior = {\n",
    "        \"test_name\": \"test_generate_time_grid\",\n",
    "        \"implied_behavior\": \"Test time grid generation with BPM\"\n",
    "    }\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Test Behavior Analysis:**\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Dictionary Structure\n",
    "```python\n",
    "test_behavior = {\n",
    "    \"test_name\": \"test_generate_time_grid\",\n",
    "    \"implied_behavior\": \"Test time grid generation with BPM\"\n",
    "}\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Data Structure Choice:**\n",
    "- **Dictionary, not Mock**: Natural data structure for test behavior\n",
    "- **Key-value pairs**: Clear attribute mapping\n",
    "- **JSON-like**: Matches actual test behavior format\n",
    "- **Serializable**: Easy to create and manipulate\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Content Design\n",
    "**Strategic Content Selection:**\n",
    "- **`test_name`**: \"test_generate_time_grid\" - mirrors requirement title\n",
    "- **`implied_behavior`**: \"Test time grid generation with BPM\" - similar to requirement description\n",
    "- **Keyword overlap**: \"time grid\", \"generation\", \"BPM\" appear in both\n",
    "- **Semantic similarity**: Same concept, different phrasing\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Alignment Strategy\n",
    "**Designed for High Similarity:**\n",
    "- **Shared keywords**: \"time grid\", \"generation\", \"BPM\"\n",
    "- **Same domain**: Rhythmic pattern generation\n",
    "- **Complementary phrasing**: Requirement vs test perspective\n",
    "- **Expected high score**: Should produce similarity > 0.0"
