    "## 4. Match Score Execution\n",
    "\n",
    "### Algorithm Invocation\n",
    "```python\n",
    "    # Calculate match score\n",
    "    score = orchestrator._calculate_match_score(mock_requirement, test_behavior)\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Execution Analysis:**\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Method Call Pattern\n",
    "```python\n",
    "score = orchestrator._calculate_match_score(mock_requirement, test_behavior)\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Parameter Strategy:**\n",
    "- **`mock_requirement`**: Requirement object with title and description\n",
    "- **`test_behavior`**: Dictionary with test name and implied behavior\n",
    "- **Private method**: `_calculate_match_score` indicates internal algorithm\n",
    "- **Direct computation**: No external dependencies during calculation\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Algorithm Expectations\n",
    "**What the Algorithm Should Do:**\n",
    "1. **Extract text**: Combine requirement title + description\n",
    "2. **Extract test text**: Use test behavior description\n",
    "3. **Text processing**: Tokenize, normalize, compare\n",
    "4. **Similarity calculation**: Compute numeric similarity score\n",
    "5. **Return score**: Float between 0.0 and 1.0\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Internal Processing (Likely Implementation)\n",
    "**Algorithm Steps:**\n",
    "```python\n",
    "# Pseudo-code of expected algorithm\n",
    "requirement_text = f\"{requirement.title} {requirement.description}\"\n",
    "test_text = test_behavior[\"implied_behavior\"]\n",
    "# Text processing: tokenization, lowercasing, stop word removal\n",
    "# Similarity calculation: cosine similarity, jaccard, etc.\n",
    "score = calculate_similarity(requirement_text, test_text)\n",
    "return score\n",
    "```"
