    "## 5. Score Validation Strategy\n",
    "\n",
    "### Multi-Level Validation\n",
    "```python\n",
    "    assert isinstance(score, float)\n",
    "    assert 0.0 <= score <= 1.0\n",
    "    assert score > 0.0  # Should have some match due to common words\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Validation Analysis:**\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Type Validation\n",
    "```python\n",
    "assert isinstance(score, float)\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Type Contract:**\n",
    "- **Float return type**: Algorithm should return numeric score\n",
    "- **Not integer**: Precision important for similarity scores\n",
    "- **Not string**: Numeric comparison needed\n",
    "- **Not None**: Valid score always returned\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Range Validation\n",
    "```python\n",
    "assert 0.0 <= score <= 1.0\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Similarity Score Constraints:**\n",
    "- **0.0 minimum**: No similarity whatsoever\n",
    "- **1.0 maximum**: Perfect similarity\n",
    "- **Inclusive bounds**: Both endpoints valid\n",
    "- **Standard range**: Typical for similarity algorithms\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Content Validation\n",
    "```python\n",
    "assert score > 0.0  # Should have some match due to common words\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Semantic Similarity Expectation:**\n",
    "- **Keyword overlap**: \"time grid\", \"generation\", \"BPM\" in both texts\n",
    "- **Domain alignment**: Both about rhythmic pattern generation\n",
    "- **Non-zero similarity**: Should detect the relationship\n",
    "- **Reasonable threshold**: Not perfect (1.0) but not zero (0.0)\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Validation Strategy Benefits\n",
    "**Multi-Layer Approach:**\n",
    "- **Type safety**: Ensures correct data type\n",
    "- **Range compliance**: Validates algorithm constraints\n",
    "- **Semantic accuracy**: Confirms meaningful similarity detection\n",
    "- **Algorithm effectiveness**: Proves the algorithm works as intended"
   ]
